# Bundled box-set definitions ship from this directory.
#
# See BoxSetService.BundledBoxSetsPath. The csproj copies *.json from here to
# bin/<config>/<tfm>/Data/box-sets/ on build; from there the distributed app
# seeds %APPDATA%/DeadEditor/box-sets/ on first launch.
#
# This .gitkeep exists so the directory is checked in even when empty. Once
# the first definition lands here, this file can be removed (or left; both
# are fine).
